flowchart TB
  A[Find a hiring post] --> B[Apply in a private message]
  B --> C{Poster accepted you?}
  C -->|No| D[Wait or leave]
  C -->|Yes| E[Pay as agreed]
  E --> F{Still want the job?}
  F -->|Canceled payment| E
  F -->|Paid| G[Wait for their work]
  G --> H[Receive drafts and updates]
  H --> I[They ask for your approval]
  I --> J{Satisfied?}
  J -->|No| K[Request revisions]
  K --> G
  J -->|Yes| L[Approve and finish]
